sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as Auth Module<br/>OAuth2 / JWKS
    participant Provider as Inference Provider<br/>(vLLM / Cloud)
    participant VectorDB as Vector DB<br/>(Milvus / PGVector / Qdrant)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP

    Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: Inference Request

    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/inference/*<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP<br/>Platform-delegated encryption
    OGX->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 bearer token<br/>(when AUTH_ISSUER configured)
    Auth-->>OGX: Token valid / owner identity
    OGX->>Provider: Forward inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS configurable)<br/>API token / IAM / bearer
    Provider-->>OGX: Inference response
    OGX->>PG: Persist state & metadata<br/>5432/TCP PostgreSQL<br/>Username/password auth
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,PG: Flow 2: RAG Query

    Client->>OGX: POST /v1/vector-io/*<br/>HTTP 8321/TCP<br/>Platform-delegated encryption
    OGX->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 bearer token<br/>(when AUTH_ISSUER configured)
    Auth-->>OGX: Token valid / owner identity
    OGX->>VectorDB: Query vectors<br/>HTTP/gRPC/SQL (configurable)<br/>Token / API key / mTLS
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Matching vectors + context
    OGX->>Provider: Inference with RAG context<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS)<br/>API token
    Provider-->>OGX: Augmented response
    OGX->>PG: Persist conversation state<br/>5432/TCP PostgreSQL<br/>Username/password auth
    PG-->>OGX: Ack
    OGX-->>Client: RAG-augmented response
